5. init
Purpose: The init API is used by the BAP to formally initiate the application process for the selected credit product. This is where the borrower provides structured user data, such as identity, financial info, crop details (optional), bank account, and purpose of the loan.
Request Payload:
{
    "context": {
        "domain": "credit-services:uki",
        "action": "init",
        "version": "1.1.0",
        "location": {
            "city": {
                "code": "std:95253"
            },
            "country": {
                "code": "IND"
            }
        },
        "bap_id": "krishi-bap.uki.in",
        "bap_uri": "https://krishi-bap.uki.in/protocol",
        "bpp_id": "grameen-fintech.com",
