            }
        }
    }
}


6. on_init
Purpose: The on_init API is the response from the BPP after receiving a loan application initiation request. It returns:
Document checklist (if needed)
Optional KYC mode (offline, video)
Payment details
This allows the BAP to proceed to form confirmation
