9. status
Purpose: The status API allows the BAP to request the latest state of a loan application. This API is used after confirm to track:
Verification steps (e.g., CIBIL, KYC)
Status of disbursement
Any intermediate workflow updates from the BPP
This is a pull-based update initiated by the BAP and typically used to power application dashboards.
Request Payload:
{
    "context": {
        "domain": "credit-services:uki",
        "action": "status",
        "version": "1.1.0",
        "location": {
            "city": {
                "code": "std:95253"
            },
            "country": {
                "code": "IND"
            }
        },
        "bap_id": "krishi-bap.uki.in",
        "bap_uri": "https://krishi-bap.uki.in/protocol",
        "bpp_id": "grameen-fintech.com",
        "bpp_uri": "https://grameen-fintech.com/credit",
        "transaction_id": "f75f8973-3261-4931-902f-6a44a7a1ea75",
        "message_id": "acd6d8c9-4f6f-4a5d-b705-3fd5ec9feaa9",
        "timestamp": "2025-06-02T09:01:30Z",
        "ttl": "PT10S"
    },
    "message": {
        "order_id": "ord01"
    }
}

10. on_status-1
